(3. Attention Mechanisms and Self-Attention) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Vaswani et al. \(2017\) introduced Attention Is All You Need, eliminating recurrence.) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Self-attention allows the model to weigh the importance of all tokens in parallel.) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Multi-head attention projects queries, keys, and values into multiple representation subspaces.) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Positional encodings provide the network with sequence order awareness.) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Pretrained models like BERT, GPT, and Gemini achieved state-of-the-art results across tasks.) Tj
0 -18 Td
