(4. Dense Representations and Vector Databases) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Words and documents are mapped into continuous dense high-dimensional vector spaces.) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Cosine similarity measures the semantic distance between queries and stored documents.) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Approximate Nearest Neighbor \(ANN\) indexing enables fast search over millions of items.) Tj
0 -18 Td
(FAISS \(Facebook AI Similarity Search\) is an efficient library for dense vector indexing.) Tj
0 -18 Td
(Vector databases serve as external memory for Large Language Models.) Tj
0 -18 Td
