0 -18 Td
() Tj
0 -18 Td
(Why is RAG used in academic assistants?) Tj
0 -18 Td
(It improves the accuracy of responses by retrieving relevant information from academic) Tj
0 -18 Td
(documents before generating the answer.) Tj
0 -18 Td
() Tj
0 -18 Td
